rn builder().kind(Kind.SESSION).value(sessionToken).build();","+    }","+","+    static CometCredentials username(@NonNull String userName) {","+        return builder().kind(Kind.USERNAME).value(userName).build();","+    }","+","+    void applyTo(@NonNull Invocation.Builder builder) {","+        switch (kind) {","+            case API_KEY -> builder.header(HttpHeaders.AUTHORIZATION, value);","+            case SESSION -> builder.cookie(RequestContext.SESSION_COOKIE, value);","+            case USERNAME -> builder.header(OAUTH_USERNAME_HEADER, value);","+        }","+    }","+}"],"additions":52,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/opik-backend/src/main/java/com/comet/opik/infrastructure/auth/OrganizationResolver.java","lines":["@@ -4,7 +4,22 @@"," "," public interface OrganizationResolver {"," ","+    /**","+     * The organization of the current request or background job.","+     * <p>","+     * Emits the organization ID, or completes empty when it is unknown: the workspace has no Comet organization, the","+     * lookup is off or failed, or the context holds no workspace. It never errors, so callers can fall back to","+     * workspace-level behaviour. Without Comet it always emits the default organization.","+     */","     Mono<String> organizationId();"," ","+    /**","+     * Checks that the caller of the current request is an admin of its workspace's organization, and emits that","+     * organization's ID, so a write can be scoped to the organization it was authorized for.","+     * <p>","+     * Errors with {@link jakarta.ws.rs.ForbiddenException} (403) when the caller isn't an admin or the organization is","+     * unknown, and with {@link jakarta.ws.rs.ServiceUnavailableException} (503) when Comet can't be asked. Without","+     * Comet there are no roles, so every caller passes and gets the default organization.","+     */","     Mono<String> requireOrganizationAdmin();"," }"],"additions":15,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/opik-b